\section*{I.2 Glossary}

\begin{description}
\item[Hydraulic Head ($H$):] Potential energy per unit weight of fluid.
\item[Volumetric Flow Rate ($Q$):] Mass-scaled fluid momentum.
\item[Dynamic Viscosity ($\mu$):] Fluid resistance to shear.
\item[Hamiltonian ($\mathcal{H}$):] Total energy functional.
\item[Symplectic Form ($\omega$):] Canonical phase-space volume element.
\item[Darcy Friction ($f$):] Empirical friction factor for pipe flow.
\item[CFL Condition:] Stability constraint for numerical wave propagation.
\item[Reynolds Number ($\mathrm{Re}$):] Ratio of inertial to viscous forces.
\item[Zeroization:] Forced cryptographic key erasure under instability.
\item[Orchestration Kernel:] Multi-engine coordination operator.
\end{description}